[issue.1737]
number = 1737
title = "[Coherence] Task 22.31.559 and decision 2632 say restart recovery keeps an EvidenceVersion refusal for legacy-archive records, but main has no such refusal, and the one change that would add it is now scheduled after 22.31.559"
revision = "a910fdedd579e63379ae6c2e4d4971990d28f8ad"
verdict = "spec-edit"
evidence = "Commits 8950f604bf7a698a739df93a15148ac30e702ef5 and dbd4e68ed94769c51ad1368826824595ec17b6f3 landed both formerly pending changes, but the done task's do_1 at spec/layerx-merge/spec.kvx:190031 and its capability at spec/layerx-merge/spec.kvx:46787 must say that public version 1 evidence is refused and any legacy archive takes precedence over current evidence, including the dual records preserved by migration at services/agent/crates/layerx-agentd/src/receipt.rs:741, because evidence_inventory returns EvidenceVersion before current-evidence decoding at services/agent/crates/layerx-agentd/src/receipt.rs:524 and services/agent/crates/layerx-agentd/src/receipt.rs:530, consistent with decision 2632 at spec/layerx-merge/spec.kvx:8907 and the restart refusal assertions at services/agent/crates/layerx-agentd/tests/outbox_recover.rs:133 and services/agent/crates/layerx-agentd/tests/outbox_recover.rs:176."
close_comment = "Restart recovery now refuses version 1 evidence and legacy archives before considering current evidence, so a migrated receipt retaining both records is refused with EvidenceVersion. The remaining correction is to align task 22.31.559 and its capability text with that refusal precedence instead of saying version 1 records enter with_evidence."
